1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,183
Elevator storage concept
A PLC coordinates the lift, shelf transfer, and return sequence. This is a concept simulation.

2
00:00:05,283 --> 00:00:13,190
Store a box
The lift carries the robot and transfer tray to the selected shelf.

3
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:21,197
Transfer at shelf height
The arm transfers the box after the platform reaches its target level.

4
00:00:21,297 --> 00:00:29,263
Return to the loading station
The sequence keeps lift positioning separate from robot transfer motion.

5
00:00:29,363 --> 00:00:42,149
Retrieve a box
The reverse sequence returns stored material to the collection station. Timing and geometry are
illustrative.
